      "headline": "Developer uses Claude Code to declutter his Android TV",
      "body": "Gathin T prompted Claude Code to remove ads and redesign the interface on his Xiaomi Android TV over Wi-Fi. The process took about 90 minutes and led him to release CleanYourTV, a tool that became a popular GitHub repository. It works on Android-based TVs without full jailbreaking.",
